[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HER-001
TITLE: Hydrogen evolution reaction
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS003.4
| 
| '''text
| 2H2O + 2e_minus -> H2 + 2OH_minus
| '''
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS003.4
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_HER_model.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HER-002
TITLE: Hydrogen evolution kinetics
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS003.4
| 
| '''matlab
| j_HER = j_0_HER .* ( ...
|     exp(alpha_a_HER .* F_C_mol .* eta_HER ./ ...
|         (R_J_molK .* T_Fe)) ...
|     - exp(-alpha_c_HER .* F_C_mol .* eta_HER ./ ...
|         (R_J_molK .* T_Fe)) ...
| );
| '''
| 
| This is an effective one-electron-transfer kinetic parameterization. The two-electron stoichiometry SHALL still be used for H2 inventory.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: conservation law
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS003.4
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_HER_model.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HER-003
TITLE: Hydrogen generation
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS003.4
| 
| '''matlab
| dn_H2_generation_dt = ...
|     -I_HER ./ (2 .* F_C_mol);
| '''
| 
| Applies to the cathodic HER branch where 'I_HER <= 0'.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: conservation law
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS003.4
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_HER_model.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HER-004
TITLE: Charging Faradaic efficiency
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS003.4
| 
| '''matlab
| eta_F_charge = ...
|     abs(I_Fe_reduction) ./ ...
|     (abs(I_Fe_reduction) + abs(I_HER));
| '''
| 
| Include additional charging parasitic currents when enabled.
| 
| The implementation SHALL avoid division by zero during idle operation.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS003.4
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_HER_model.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HER-005
TITLE: Hydrogen gas inventory
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirements: SRS003.4, SRS009
| 
| '''matlab
| dn_H2_gas_dt = ...
|     dn_H2_generation_dt ...
|     - n_dot_H2_vent ...
|     - n_dot_H2_dissolution;
| '''
| 
| ---
| 
