UID: AIR-003
TITLE: Air electrode equilibrium potential
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirements: SRS004.1, SRS004.2, SRS019
| 
| '''matlab
| e_O2_eq = e_O2_std + ...
|     (R_J_molK .* T_air ./ (4 .* F_C_mol)) .* ...
|     log((a_O2 .* a_H2O.^2) ./ a_OH.^4);
| '''
<<<
