RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS004.2
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_air_electrode_ode.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AIR-006
TITLE: Oxygen reduction consumption
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS004.1
| 
| '''matlab
| n_dot_O2_ORR = ...
|     -I_ORR ./ (4 .* F_C_mol);
| '''
| 
| Defined as a positive consumption rate when 'I_ORR < 0'.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: conservation law
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS004.1
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_air_electrode_ode.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AIR-007
TITLE: Oxygen evolution production
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS004.2
| 
| '''matlab
| n_dot_O2_OER = ...
|     I_OER ./ (4 .* F_C_mol);
| '''
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS004.2
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_air_electrode_ode.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AIR-008
TITLE: Oxygen diffusion limiting current density
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS004.4
| 
| '''matlab
| j_lim_O2 = ...
|     4 .* F_C_mol .* D_O2_eff .* ...
|     c_O2_bulk ./ delta_diffusion;
| '''
| 
| 'j_lim_O2' is the positive magnitude of the limiting current density.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS004.4
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_air_electrode_ode.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AIR-009
TITLE: Concentration polarization
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS004.4
| 
| '''matlab
| eta_conc_ORR_abs = ...
|     -(R_J_molK .* T_air ./ (4 .* F_C_mol)) .* ...
|     log(1 - abs(j_ORR) ./ j_lim_O2);
| '''
| 
| This reduced-order expression SHALL only be evaluated inside its physical domain.
| 
| The detailed model SHALL preferably derive concentration polarization from resolved local oxygen activity.
| 
| ---
| 
