  VALUE: SRS004.4
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS006
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrochemistry/ironair_air_electrode_ode.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GDL-001
TITLE: Fickian oxygen diffusion
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS006
| 
| '''matlab
| N_O2 = -D_O2_eff .* grad_c_O2;
| '''
| 
| 'grad_c_O2' represents the spatial concentration gradient.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS006
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/air/ironair_gas_diffusion_layer.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GDL-002
TITLE: Effective oxygen diffusivity
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS006
| 
| '''matlab
| D_O2_eff = ...
|     D_O2_bulk .* epsilon_g ./ tau_g;
| '''
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS006
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/air/ironair_gas_diffusion_layer.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GDL-003
TITLE: Transient oxygen concentration
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS006
| 
| '''matlab
| dc_O2_dt = ...
|     divergence_D_grad_c_O2 - R_O2;
| '''
| 
| Where:
| 
| '''matlab
| divergence_D_grad_c_O2 = ...
|     div(D_O2_eff .* grad_c_O2);
| '''
| 
| 'div' is conceptual notation here. Cursor SHALL implement the spatial divergence using a base-MATLAB finite-volume or finite-difference operator, not assume a built-in 'div' function provides the required discretized transport solver.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS006
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/air/ironair_gas_diffusion_layer.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GDL-004
TITLE: Gas-liquid capillary pressure
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS006
| 
| '''matlab
| p_capillary = p_gas - p_liquid;
| '''
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS006
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/air/ironair_gas_diffusion_layer.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GDL-005
TITLE: Representative pore capillary pressure
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS006
| 
| '''matlab
| p_capillary = ...
|     2 .* gamma_surface .* cos(theta_contact) ./ r_pore;
| '''
| 
| Wetting and curvature sign conventions SHALL be explicitly documented.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS006
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/air/ironair_gas_diffusion_layer.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GDL-006
TITLE: Saturation-dependent diffusivity
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS006
| 
| '''matlab
| D_O2_eff = ...
|     D_O2_bulk .* epsilon_g_S ./ tau_g_S;
| '''
| 
| Both porosity and tortuosity SHALL depend on liquid saturation when the flooding model is enabled.
| 
