[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ELY-001
TITLE: Nernst-Planck species flux
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS005.1
| 
| '''matlab
| N_i = ...
|     -D_i .* grad_c_i ...
|     -z_i .* D_i .* F_C_mol ./ ...
|         (R_J_molK .* T_electrolyte) .* ...
|         c_i .* grad_phi_l ...
|     +c_i .* v_electrolyte;
| '''
| 
| This dilute-solution form SHALL only be used within its assumed validity. Concentrated KOH requires a suitable concentrated-solution transport model.
<<<
COMMENT: Classification: constitutive equation
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS005.1
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: components/electrolyte/ironair_electrolyte_ode.m
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/test_equations_electrochemistry.m

