[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GRID-006
TITLE: Time-qualified grid fault
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS013
| 
| During an active, qualifying violation:
| 
| '''matlab
| dt_violation_dt = 1;
| '''
| 
| Otherwise the timer SHALL reset, hold, or recover according to the selected protection characteristic.
| 
| Trip condition:
| 
| '''matlab
| trip_command = ...
|     t_violation >= t_trip_configured;
| '''
| 
| The implementation SHALL use the correct voltage and frequency time-domain protection envelopes rather than only fixed pass/fail thresholds.
| 
