[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-005
TITLE: AC-to-AC round-trip efficiency
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirements: SRS007, SRS012, SRS023
| 
| '''matlab
| eta_round_trip_AC = ...
|     E_grid_export_J ./ E_grid_import_J;
| '''
| 
| Where:
| 
| '''matlab
| E_grid_export_J = ...
|     trapz(t_sim, P_grid_export);
| 
| E_grid_import_J = ...
|     trapz(t_sim, P_grid_import);
| '''
| 
| The calculation SHALL include all applicable auxiliary loads and shall compare equivalent initial and final stored-energy states.
<<<
