[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-006
TITLE: Coupled DAE differential equations
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS018
| 
| '''matlab
| M_system * dx_dt = ...
|     f_system;
| '''
| 
| This is the mathematical residual form.
| 
| In actual MATLAB source, the model SHALL return a correctly assembled mass matrix and right-hand-side function to a compatible base-MATLAB solver, rather than use assignment to 'M_system * dx_dt'.
<<<
