  VALUE: tests/test_equations_system.m

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-007
TITLE: Algebraic constraints
STATEMENT: >>>
| Requirement: SRS018
| 
| '''matlab
| e_algebraic = ...
|     g_system;
| '''
| 
| Required mathematical condition:
| 
| '''matlab
| e_algebraic = 0;
| '''
| 
| In executable MATLAB, residuals SHALL be solved with the appropriate nonlinear or DAE solver.
| 
| The algebraic subsystem SHALL include applicable electrode potentials, interface currents, node voltages, current distribution, species constraints, and fluid network conditions.
| 
| ---
<<<
